msgid "Migrate legacy configuration and interface access"
msgstr "迁移旧配置与接口访问"

msgid ""
"Use this guide to migrate an older HAL/OSAL/Kconfig consumer to the current "
"Source SDK generation. Keep a fixed source revision while migrating. The "
"platform retains typed factory plus C polymorphic interfaces; it changes "
"instance generation and ownership rather than replacing interfaces with a "
"runtime service registry. The [compatibility contract](../design/source-"
"compatibility.md) owns version and interface epoch behavior."
msgstr ""
"本指南将旧 HAL/OSAL/Kconfig 消费者迁移到当前 Source SDK 代际。迁移期间固定源码版本。平台保留类型化工厂与 C "
"多态接口，改变实例生成和所有权，不以运行时服务注册表替代接口。[兼容合同](../design/source-"
"compatibility.md)拥有版本与接口 epoch 行为。"

msgid ""
"Obtain the [fixed source and recursive dependencies](source-checkout.md) "
"first; keep the old consumer in its own checkout while validating the new "
"one."
msgstr "先取得[固定源码与递归依赖](source-checkout.md)；验证新消费工程时，将旧消费工程保留在自己的 checkout 中。"

msgid "Legacy pattern"
msgstr "旧模式"

msgid "Current migration action"
msgstr "当前迁移动作"

msgid "Kconfig or cache macros selecting instances"
msgstr "用 Kconfig 或缓存宏选择实例"

msgid "Write one complete schema-2 TOML assembly"
msgstr "编写一份完整 schema-2 TOML 装配"

msgid "Macro-driven object construction during lookup"
msgstr "查找期间以宏构造对象"

msgid "Use generated static objects; factory lookup only returns identity"
msgstr "使用生成静态对象；factory 查找仅返回身份"

msgid "HAL/OSAL implementation pointers in products"
msgstr "产品持有 HAL/OSAL 实现指针"

msgid "Include public Nexus APIs and generated `nexus_factory_strong.h`"
msgstr "包含公共 Nexus API 和生成的 `nexus_factory_strong.h`"

msgid "First SPI/I2C child used as bus"
msgstr "以首个 SPI/I2C 子端点充当总线"

msgid "Obtain controller and endpoint separately with their typed getters"
msgstr "通过各自类型化获取函数分别取得控制器和端点"

msgid "Global maximum pools or default task"
msgstr "全局最大池或默认任务"

msgid "Provide exact selected buffers, slots and application workers"
msgstr "明确提供所选缓冲区、槽和应用执行任务"

msgid "Cancel/timeout followed by immediate reuse"
msgstr "Cancel/超时后立即复用"

msgid "Keep borrow until acquire-observed SETTLED and observer drain"
msgstr "保持借用到 acquire 观察 SETTLED 并排空观察者"

msgid "Platform-owned product partition or policy"
msgstr "平台拥有产品分区或策略"

msgid "Move reservations, roles and recovery to the external product"
msgstr "将预留、角色和恢复移入外部产品"

msgid "Move one complete assembly"
msgstr "迁移一份完整装配"

msgid ""
"Inspect this maintained F407ZG assembly; it is complete, not a fragment:"
msgstr "检查这份受维护的 F407ZG 装配；它是完整输入，不是片段："

msgid "Current schema-2 F407ZG UART input."
msgstr "当前 schema-2 F407ZG UART 输入。"

msgid "Run from the repository root with Python 3.11+ and CMake 3.31+ on `PATH`, after preparing the selected dependencies. CMake is required by the compatibility check's real package-version tests. Execute the actual parser and generation path:"
msgstr "准备所选依赖后，在仓库根目录运行；`PATH` 中需要 Python 3.11+ 和 CMake 3.31+。兼容性检查会执行真实的 package-version 测试，因此需要 CMake。执行实际解析与生成路径："

msgid ""
"Use a new output path you own, and stop if any command returns nonzero. "
"Successful resolution reports the selected part, Board, backend and "
"configuration digest; the compatibility check must accept epoch 5. "
"Inspect `resolved.json`, `nexus_config.h`, `nexus_factory.h`, "
"`nexus_factory_strong.h` and `nexus_bindings.h`. The version macros "
"checked by `--generated` are in `nexus_config.h`. These commands validate"
" and generate configuration; they do not compile firmware or execute "
"hardware. Retain needed diagnostics before removing only your generated "
"output. Never author the resolved output or reuse stale generated files "
"after a failure. Legacy schema-1 JSON is no longer a platform input. "
"Convert it to a complete schema-2 TOML assembly; generated "
"`resolved.json` remains audit output only. A failed TOML does not fall "
"back to JSON, Kconfig, old headers or cache values. Frozen historical "
"evidence remains verifiable under its original format; this read-only "
"retention does not reopen old configuration or generation paths."
msgstr ""
"使用你拥有的新输出路径；任何命令返回非零值时都应停止。解析成功后会报告选定器件、Board、backend 和配置摘要；兼容性检查必须接受 "
"epoch 5。检查 "
"`resolved.json`、`nexus_config.h`、`nexus_factory.h`、`nexus_factory_strong.h`"
" 和 `nexus_bindings.h`。`--generated` 检查的版本宏位于 "
"`nexus_config.h`。这些命令校验并生成配置，不编译固件，也不执行硬件。删除输出前先保留所需诊断，并且只删除你生成的输出。绝不手写解析输出，也不在失败后复用陈旧生成文件。旧"
" schema-1 JSON 不再是平台输入。将其转换为完整的 schema-2 TOML 装配；生成的 `resolved.json` "
"仍仅用于审计输出。TOML 失败时不会回退到 "
"JSON、Kconfig、旧头文件或缓存值。冻结历史证据仍可按原格式校验；这种只读保留不会重新开放旧配置或生成路径。"

msgid "Move access and lifecycle together"
msgstr "同时迁移访问与生命周期"

msgid "Use compact typed IDs from the current assembly and check getter NULL results. Getter names and ID constants are generated from authored instance names; IDs are not persistent IDs or a binary ABI. Every Platform assembly emits `nexus_factory_strong.h`; new calls should use its class-specific `NX_*_REF_*` constants and `nx_factory_*_ref()` getters. No configuration field enables strong references. Optional capability records are selected separately with `factory.capabilities`. Start hardware through `nx_platform_start()` and inspect primary, cleanup and remaining-effects results. After successful startup, ordinary I/O uses the returned face directly."
msgstr "使用当前装配的紧凑类型 ID，并检查 getter 的 NULL 结果。getter 名和 ID 常量由人工实例名生成；ID 不是持久化标识或二进制 ABI。每个 Platform 装配都生成 `nexus_factory_strong.h`；新调用应使用其中类别独立的 `NX_*_REF_*` 常量和 `nx_factory_*_ref()` getter。强类型引用无需任何配置字段启用。可选 capability 记录通过 `factory.capabilities` 单独选择。通过 `nx_platform_start()` 启动硬件，并检查 primary、cleanup 和 remaining-effects 结果。启动成功后，日常 I/O 直接使用返回的 face。"

msgid ""
"Convert synchronous and asynchronous calls according to their actual mode. "
"For accepted requests, migrate storage lifetime, service/wait progress, "
"cancellation, settlement and shutdown together. [The async "
"tutorial](../tutorials/async-io.md) executes these failure paths; replacing "
"a function spelling alone is insufficient."
msgstr ""
"依据实际模式转换同步与异步调用。对于已接受的请求，同时迁移存储生命周期、service/wait "
"进度、取消、结束与停机。[异步教程](../tutorials/async-io.md)执行这些失败路径；只替换函数名不足以完成迁移。"

msgid ""
"Build an independent relocated [SDK consumer](../tutorials/source-sdk.md), "
"then link the exact MCU configuration with the locked compiler. Retain "
"evidence for the migrated source and configuration. Old HAL/OSAL "
"documentation remains historical; a redirect does not make an old API "
"contract equivalent to a new one."
msgstr ""
"构建独立搬移的 [SDK 消费者](../tutorials/source-sdk.md)，再用锁定编译器链接精确 MCU "
"配置。保留迁移源码/配置的证据。旧 HAL/OSAL 文档保持历史身份；redirect 不使旧 API 合同等同于新合同。"

msgid "Rebuild for source interface epoch 5"
msgstr "为源码接口 epoch 5 重新编译"

msgid ""
"The current development snapshot keeps semantic version `0.2.1` and uses "
"factory/source interface epoch `5`. Pin its exact commit, regenerate the "
"bundle and rebuild every caller, public face/ops, generated factory, "
"provider and component with one configuration and toolchain. Current "
"interface admission rejects epoch-1 through epoch-4 SDKs. Select a new "
"build directory so old CMake caches, generated headers and objects cannot"
" enter the new application. Keep the old build separate until the "
"migrated consumer passes its required checks. No stable binary ABI is "
"supplied. A development-fixture opt-in does not relax interface checks. "
"Existing tags are unchanged."
msgstr ""
"当前开发快照保留语义版本 `0.2.1`，采用 factory／源码接口 epoch `5`。固定其精确提交，重新生成 "
"bundle，并使用同一配置和工具链重新编译每个调用者、公共 face／ops、生成 factory、provider 和组件。当前接口准入拒绝 "
"epoch-1 至 epoch-4 的 SDK。选择新构建目录，避免旧 CMake "
"缓存、生成头文件和对象文件进入新应用。在迁移后的消费者通过所需检查之前，保持旧构建独立。不提供稳定二进制 ABI。显式选择 "
"development-fixture 不会放宽接口检查。既有标签保持不变。"

msgid ""
"The version fields remain independent: authored TOML schema `2`, typed IR"
" source epoch `5`, factory/source interface epoch `5`, resolved JSON "
"projection `1` and installed SDK manifest schema `2`. A matching semantic"
" version or manifest schema does not establish matching interface "
"generation."
msgstr ""
"各版本字段保持独立：手写 TOML schema `2`、类型化 IR 源码 epoch `5`、factory／源码接口 epoch "
"`5`、resolved JSON projection `1` 和已安装 SDK manifest schema `2`。语义版本或 "
"manifest schema 相同，并不证明接口代际相同。"

msgid ""
"Epoch 5 replaces the F407-named power integration header with "
"`nexus/soc/stm32f4_power.h` and family power entry points. Hash "
"constraints now report input/key length multiples separately from address"
" alignment. Rebuild all query callers and validate the selected "
"instance's limits. Optional SMBus static bindings are supplied by "
"`nexus_smbus_factory.h`; ordinary factory headers do not depend on the "
"component. The [epoch-5 contract](../design/source-"
"compatibility.md#epoch-5-的家族电源接口与密码查询迁移) owns the exact migration and "
"selection limits."
msgstr ""
"Epoch 5 使用 `nexus/soc/stm32f4_power.h` 和家族电源入口替换以 F407 命名的电源集成头文件。Hash "
"约束现在分别报告输入／key 长度倍数和地址对齐要求。重新编译所有查询调用者，并校验选定实例的限制。可选 SMBus 静态绑定由 "
"`nexus_smbus_factory.h` 提供；普通 factory 头文件不依赖该组件。[epoch-5 合同](../design"
"/source-compatibility.md#epoch-5-的家族电源接口与密码查询迁移)规定精确迁移要求和选择限制。"

msgid ""
"Epoch 4 changes `nx_uart_rs485_config_t.direction` to `const "
"nx_gpio_signal_t*`; remove the adapter's old `mask` and `active_high` "
"fields. Declare `active_high` explicitly on the single-pin GPIO selection"
" and obtain its immutable binding with `nx_factory_gpio_signal_ref()` "
"using the same GPIO strong reference. Check for NULL: an ordinary GPIO "
"without an authored polarity has no generated signal. Do not infer "
"polarity from its initial level. Manually assembled signals must name one"
" authorized pin and outlive the adapter, successful stop and all external"
" observers. Timing, wire completion and retained borrows remain "
"unchanged. The [epoch-4 migration contract](../design/source-"
"compatibility.md#epoch-4-的逻辑-signal-与-rs485-迁移) owns the full binding and"
" rebuild requirements."
msgstr ""
"epoch 4 将 `nx_uart_rs485_config_t.direction` 改为 `const "
"nx_gpio_signal_t*`；删除 adapter 原有的 `mask` 和 `active_high` 字段。在单 pin GPIO "
"选择中显式声明 `active_high`，用相同 GPIO 强类型引用通过 `nx_factory_gpio_signal_ref()` "
"获取不可变绑定。检查 NULL：未编写极性的普通 GPIO 没有生成 signal，不得从初始电平推导极性。手工 signal 必须指定一个已授权"
" pin，其存储必须保持至 adapter 成功停止及所有外部观察者排空。时间、wire completion "
"和已保留借用的合同不变。[epoch-4 迁移合同](../design/source-"
"compatibility.md#epoch-4-的逻辑-signal-与-rs485-迁移)维护完整绑定和重编要求。"

#: docs/guides/migration.md:0
msgid "The epoch-2 ADC result migration remains required when upgrading older callers. For ADC groups, direct `request.frames` access becomes `request.output.frames`. Prefer `nx_adc_group_prepare()` for raw requests: it installs the explicit RAW `results_kind`. Use `nx_adc_group_prepare_results()` for a paired regular/injected result descriptor. Inspect the selected discriminant before reading the union; a raw pointer must never be reinterpreted as a paired descriptor. No compatibility shadow field or runtime layout inference is provided. Request, descriptor and both spans retain one lifetime through acquire-observed SETTLED."
msgstr "升级旧调用者仍须完成 epoch-2 ADC 结果迁移。ADC group 的直接 `request.frames` 访问改为 `request.output.frames`。raw 请求优先使用 `nx_adc_group_prepare()`，由它设置明确的 RAW `results_kind`。regular／injected paired 结果 descriptor 使用 `nx_adc_group_prepare_results()`。读取 union 前先核对 discriminant，raw 指针不得解释为 paired descriptor。不提供兼容影子字段或运行时布局推断。request、descriptor 与两个 span 共同借用到 acquire 观察 SETTLED。"

#: docs/guides/migration.md:0
msgid "Use public domain traits from `nexus/io/traits.h` instead of generated `nx_factory_*_traits_t` typedefs. Generic capabilities use `nx_io_capability_t` and `NX_IO_CAP_*`; enhanced SPI endpoint traits use `nx_spi_transaction_traits_t`, while I2C provider profiles use `nx_i2c_limits_t`. Factory lookup still returns selected immutable facts; it does not initialize hardware or prove readiness. SDIO function requests now contain `base`, payload and function-local address fields directly. Replace `request.transfer.base` and other nested accesses with the direct fields, remove `first_block = 0`, and never cast an SDIO request to a block request. Follow the public encoder modes, error enums and checksum semantics rather than retaining old numeric encodings."
msgstr "使用 `nexus/io/traits.h` 的公共领域 traits，替代生成的 `nx_factory_*_traits_t` typedef。通用 capability 使用 `nx_io_capability_t` 和 `NX_IO_CAP_*`；增强 SPI endpoint traits 使用 `nx_spi_transaction_traits_t`，I2C provider profile 使用 `nx_i2c_limits_t`。factory 查询仍只返回所选不可变事实，不初始化硬件或证明 ready。SDIO function 请求直接包含 `base`、payload 和 function-local 地址字段。将 `request.transfer.base` 等嵌套访问改为直接字段，删除 `first_block = 0`，不得将 SDIO 请求转成块设备请求。按公共编码器模式、错误枚举和校验语义迁移，不能保留旧数字编码来猜测含义。"

msgid "Migrate payload direction explicitly. Construct I2C writes with `nx_i2c_message_write()` and reads with `nx_i2c_message_read()`; replace old message `.data` access with the matching `buffer.tx` or `buffer.rx`. Prepare block writes with `nx_block_write_prepare()` and reads with `nx_block_read_prepare()`. Do not change only the direction flag to reinterpret the other union member. Preparation does not admit or borrow a request. The selected provider's bounds still apply; the removed `i2c_long` entry is not an alternative transfer engine."
msgstr "显式迁移 payload 方向。I2C 写使用 `nx_i2c_message_write()` 构造，读使用 `nx_i2c_message_read()`；旧 message `.data` 访问改为对应的 `buffer.tx` 或 `buffer.rx`。块写使用 `nx_block_write_prepare()`，块读使用 `nx_block_read_prepare()`。不得只改方向标志来重解释另一 union 成员。准备不准入请求，也不取得借用。所选 provider 的限额仍生效；已删除的 `i2c_long` 入口不是另一套传输引擎。"

msgid "Review consumers of EXTI sources, private UART configuration, logical CAN filter tags, USB Host pipe IDs and ADC/DAC units. Their values cannot be recovered by preserving old register encodings or structure sizes. The [epoch-3 field migration table](../design/source-compatibility.md#epoch-3-的领域接口迁移) owns these mappings, including encoder, NAND and Flash maintenance semantics. Use the corresponding public header for complete operation and borrow contracts."
msgstr "审查使用 EXTI 来源、私有 UART 配置、逻辑 CAN filter tag、USB Host pipe ID 及 ADC/DAC 单位的消费者。保留旧寄存器编码或结构大小无法恢复这些值的含义。[epoch-3 字段迁移表](../design/source-compatibility.md#epoch-3-的领域接口迁移)统一维护这些映射，包括 encoder、NAND 与 Flash 维护语义。完整操作和借用合同以相应公共头为准。"

msgid "Discard old generated output and rebuild from the pinned source. The [compatibility contract](../design/source-compatibility.md) defines epoch and manifest admission; a matching semantic version alone does not permit mixing source generations or binary objects. For an installed SDK, follow the [existing-product upgrade commands](../tutorials/source-sdk.md#upgrade-an-existing-product) with its verified prefix and exact source revision. Run the migrated product's Native contracts and selected MCU build before accepting it. A generation check or successful link does not establish physical qualification."
msgstr "丢弃旧生成输出，从固定源码重新构建。[兼容性合同](../design/source-compatibility.md)定义 epoch 和 manifest 准入；semantic version 相同不足以混用不同源码代际或二进制对象。对于已安装 SDK，使用已验证 prefix 和精确源码 revision，执行[现有产品升级命令](../tutorials/source-sdk.md#upgrade-an-existing-product)。接受迁移前，运行产品自己的 Native 合同与所选 MCU 构建。代际检查或链接成功不建立物理资格。"

msgid "Update private source integrations"
msgstr "更新私有源码接入"

msgid "Production ownership is one `soc/stm32/stm32f4/` package. Exact parts and modes follow the [current support catalogue](../delivery/support.md); obsolete family names are rejected rather than mapped to a replacement. Existing F407 assemblies select `stm32f4` with an exact part. Public C interfaces remain the consumption boundary; added internal-CRC references do not change product wiring."
msgstr "生产源码归入同一个 `soc/stm32/stm32f4/` 包。精确料号与模式遵循[当前支持目录](../delivery/support.md)；失效系列名直接拒绝，不映射为替代实现。已有 F407 装配以精确料号选择 `stm32f4`。公共 C 接口仍是消费边界；新增内部 CRC 参考不改变产品接线。"

msgid ""
"Board and SoC trees contain no Python plugins. Current generation is "
"centralized under `tools/configure/stm32f4/`; firmware hardware algorithms "
"and lifecycle remain handwritten C. Native fixtures live under "
"`tests/support/native/` and require explicit test support."
msgstr ""
"Board 和 SoC 树不包含 Python 插件。当前生成逻辑集中在 "
"`tools/configure/stm32f4/`；固件硬件算法和生命周期仍直接采用手写 C。Native 测试支撑位于 "
"`tests/support/native/`，必须显式启用测试范围。"

msgid ""
"Private F4 IP belongs to `soc/stm32/stm32f4/drivers/ip/`; there is no root "
"MCU `drivers/` directory. Update private includes, configuration inputs, "
"CMake source selection and SDK payload together. The [source "
"map](../explanation/source-map.md) and [provider guide](provider-porting.md)"
" describe current ownership. Original cross-family layouts remain traceable "
"at the [fixed prior source](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/tree/8e147fc2c812d81ab6596e0d1a6bc8908d30ac18)."
msgstr ""
"私有 F4 IP 归属 `soc/stm32/stm32f4/drivers/ip/`；顶层不再有 MCU `drivers/` 目录。私有 "
"include、配置输入、CMake 选编与 SDK payload 必须一同更新。[源码地图](../explanation/source-"
"map.md)和 [provider 指南](provider-"
"porting.md)说明当前归属。原始跨系列布局可从[固定旧源码](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/tree/8e147fc2c812d81ab6596e0d1a6bc8908d30ac18)追溯。"

msgid ""
"Resolve the actual assembly, exercise complete provider contracts and build "
"a relocated consumer. Source movement establishes neither new modes nor "
"physical qualification; no previous candidate transfers to this revision."
msgstr ""
"解析真实 assembly，执行完整 provider 合同并构建可搬移消费者。源码移动既不建立新模式，也不赋予物理资格；原候选不能转移到本次修订。"
